Less wise, in fact, since putting the BoH into the sack means that any
curses will hit the sack rather than the BoH; doing it the other way
'round means that that curse will hit the BoH, and if you then
accidentally loot it, you might lose all your stuff in one stroke of bad
luck.
Not that I ever bother with oilskin sacks or curse-catchers, myself; but
if you want to play it safe, put the BoH inside the oilskin sack, not
the other way 'round.

